","chinese":"不可内服"},{"english":"you should take something for your stomach","chinese":"你应当吃点胃药"},{"english":"do you take sugar in your tea?","chinese":"你喝茶放糖吗？"}]},{"id":"take:o:249b19e4f12b","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"接受","contexts":["remedy"]},{"id":"take:o:f87173655075","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"喝","contexts":["drink","milk"]},{"id":"take:o:b87066051fd6","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"记录","glossesEn":["record"],"examples":[{"english":"can I take your name and address, please?","chinese":"可否请你留下姓名和地址？"},{"english":"to take the minutes (of a meeting)","chinese":"做会议记录"}]},{"id":"take:o:8e5280b9031c","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"拍","domains":["Photography"],"contexts":["photo","picture"]},{"id":"take:o:d32ef4d2da89","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"测量","glossesEn":["measure"],"contexts":["pulse","temperature"],"examples":[{"english":"to take sb's blood pressure","chinese":"给某人量血压"},{"english":"to take a reading","chinese":"记录读数"},{"english":"to take sb's measurements","chinese":"为某人量尺寸"}]},{"id":"take:o:950524353220","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"占","glossesEn":["occupy"],"contexts":["chair","place"],"examples":[{"english":"take a seat!","chinese":"坐吧！"}]},{"id":"take:o:b14558cfc3f7","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"以…为例","glossesEn":["consider as example"],"examples":[{"english":"let us or if we take the situation in France","chinese":"我们以法国的情况为例"},{"english":"take John (for example)","chinese":"比方说约翰"}]},{"id":"take:o:411e3a83d1bb","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"接受","glossesEn":["accept sth"],"examples":[{"english":"to take advice","chinese":"接受建议"},{"english":"to take a job","chinese":"接受工作"},{"english":"take it or leave it","chinese":"要就要，不要就算；无所谓"}]},{"id":"take:o:5c7bf4e4794f","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"接纳","glossesEn":["accept, admit sb"]},{"id":"take:o:ef68c4e62d93","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"收入","glossesEn":["earn"],"examples":[{"english":"the shop takes £2,500 a week","chinese":"这家商店每周的赢利为2,500英镑"}]},{"id":"take:o:a81bba029194","label":"vt.","definit